<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Welcome to WORKTIMEFLOW</title>
    <style>
        /* Basic, email-safe styles (inline CSS preferred for broad client support) */
        body { margin:0; padding:20px; background:#f4f4f4; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1f2937; }
        .container { max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
        .header { background:#10b981; color:#ffffff; text-align:center; padding:18px; }
        .content { padding:20px 22px; }
        .footer  { padding:12px 22px 20px; text-align:center; font-size:12px; color:#6b7280; }
        h2 { margin:0; font-size:20px; line-height:1.3; }
        p  { margin:0 0 12px; line-height:1.55; }
        ul { margin:12px 0; padding:12px 14px; background:#f3f4f6; border-radius:6px; }
        li { margin:6px 0; }
        .password { color:#dc2626; font-weight:bold; }
        .btn {
            display:inline-block; background:#10b981; color:#111827; text-decoration:none;
            padding:10px 16px; border-radius:6px; font-weight:bold; margin-top:8px;
        }
        .muted { color:#6b7280; font-size:12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h2>Welcome to WORKTIMEFLOW</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello <strong>{{ username }}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Your WORKTIMEFLOW account has been created.</p>

        <p><strong>Your login details:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> {{ user_email }}</li>
            <li><strong>Temporary password:</strong> <span class="password">{{ password }}</span></li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            <strong>Security tip:</strong> Please sign in as soon as possible and
            <strong>change your password</strong> from your account/profile settings.
        </p>

        <p>
            <a class="btn" href="{{ login_url }}">Log in to WORKTIMEFLOW</a>
        </p>

        <p class="muted">
            If you didn’t expect this account, please contact your administrator.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Best regards,<br><strong>WORKTIMEFLOW Team</strong></p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
